<br/>
For &#36;12.99 per month or 129 per year in the U.S., a Creator Studio subscription provides access to full-featured versions of Final Cut Pro, Logic Pro, Pixelmator Pro, Motion, Compressor, MainStage, Keynote, Pages, Numbers, and Freeform.<br/>
<br/>
One-time-purchase versions of Final Cut Pro, Logic Pro, Pixelmator Pro, Motion, Compressor, and MainStage remain available on the Mac App Store.<br/>
<br/>
Free versions of Keynote, Pages, Numbers, and Freeform continue to be available, but they do not receive all of the new Creator Studio features.<br/>
